*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% PPD file for E210 Bluetooth Thermal Printer
*% Copyright (C) 2026 E210 Thermal Printer Linux Project

*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.4"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "E210.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Generic"
*Product: "(E210 Thermal Printer)"
*ModelName: "E210 Thermal Printer"
*ShortNickName: "E210"
*NickName: "E210 Thermal Printer (CUPS)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42

*% CUPS raster filter
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 100 rastertoe210"
*cupsLanguages: "en"
*cupsVersion: 2.4

*% Resolution
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 DPI: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% Media Types
*OpenUI *MediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: Continuous
*MediaType Continuous/Continuous Paper: "<</MediaType(Continuous)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Gap/Die-cut Label (Gap): "<</MediaType(Gap)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType BlackMark/Black Mark Label: "<</MediaType(BlackMark)>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*% Print Density / Darkness (Calibrated 5-10 practical range)
*OpenUI *Darkness/Print Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Darkness
*DefaultDarkness: 10
*Darkness 4/Draft Light (4): ""
*Darkness 5/Normal Light (5): ""
*Darkness 6/Normal (6): ""
*Darkness 7/Medium (7): ""
*Darkness 8/Dark (8): ""
*Darkness 9/Very Dark (9): ""
*Darkness 10/Dark (10 - Default): ""
*CloseUI: *Darkness

*% Dithering
*OpenUI *Dither/Dithering Method: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *Dither
*DefaultDither: Atkinson
*Dither Atkinson/Atkinson Error Diffusion: ""
*Dither FloydSteinberg/Floyd-Steinberg Error Diffusion: ""
*Dither Bayer/Bayer 4x4 Ordered Dithering: ""
*Dither Clustered/Clustered 8x8 Halftone: ""
*Dither Threshold/Fixed Threshold (Text/Line Art): ""
*CloseUI: *Dither

*% Fit artwork rather than printing a small image inside a long white document page.
*OpenUI *E210Scaling/Image Sizing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 45 AnySetup *E210Scaling
*DefaultE210Scaling: FitContent
*E210Scaling FitContent/Fit Artwork to Label: ""
*E210Scaling ActualSize/Preserve Document Size: ""
*CloseUI: *E210Scaling

*% Page Sizes
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: 50x100mm
*PageSize 50x100mm/50mm Continuous Roll: "<</PageSize[141.732283 283.464567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 50x80mm/50 x 80 mm Label: "<</PageSize[141.732283 226.771654]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 50x70mm/50 x 70 mm Label: "<</PageSize[141.732283 198.425197]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 50x50mm/50 x 50 mm Label: "<</PageSize[141.732283 141.732283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 30x50mmRotated/50 x 30 mm Label: "<</PageSize[141.732283 85.039370]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 40x60mm/40 x 60 mm Label: "<</PageSize[113.385827 170.078740]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 30x40mmRotated/40 x 30 mm Label: "<</PageSize[113.385827 85.039370]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 30x30mm/30 x 30 mm Label: "<</PageSize[85.039370 85.039370]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 20x30mmRotated/30 x 20 mm Label: "<</PageSize[85.039370 56.692913]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 25x38mmRotated/38 x 25 mm Cable Wrap Tag: "<</PageSize[107.716535 70.866142]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: 50x100mm
*PageRegion 50x100mm/50mm Continuous Roll: "<</PageSize[141.732283 283.464567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 50x80mm/50 x 80 mm Label: "<</PageSize[141.732283 226.771654]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 50x70mm/50 x 70 mm Label: "<</PageSize[141.732283 198.425197]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 50x50mm/50 x 50 mm Label: "<</PageSize[141.732283 141.732283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 30x50mmRotated/50 x 30 mm Label: "<</PageSize[141.732283 85.039370]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 40x60mm/40 x 60 mm Label: "<</PageSize[113.385827 170.078740]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 30x40mmRotated/40 x 30 mm Label: "<</PageSize[113.385827 85.039370]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 30x30mm/30 x 30 mm Label: "<</PageSize[85.039370 85.039370]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 20x30mmRotated/30 x 20 mm Label: "<</PageSize[85.039370 56.692913]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 25x38mmRotated/38 x 25 mm Cable Wrap Tag: "<</PageSize[107.716535 70.866142]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% Imageable Area (left bottom right top)
*DefaultImageableArea: 50x100mm
*ImageableArea 50x100mm/50mm Continuous Roll: "2.834646 0 138.897638 283.464567"
*ImageableArea 50x80mm/50 x 80 mm Label: "2.834646 0 138.897638 226.771654"
*ImageableArea 50x70mm/50 x 70 mm Label: "2.834646 0 138.897638 198.425197"
