*ImageableArea 30x50mmRotated/50 x 30 mm Label: "2.834646 0 138.897638 85.039370"
*ImageableArea 40x60mm/40 x 60 mm Label: "2.834646 0 110.551181 170.078740"
*ImageableArea 30x40mmRotated/40 x 30 mm Label: "2.834646 0 110.551181 85.039370"
*ImageableArea 30x30mm/30 x 30 mm Label: "2.834646 0 82.204724 85.039370"
*ImageableArea 20x30mmRotated/30 x 20 mm Label: "2.834646 0 82.204724 56.692913"
*ImageableArea 25x38mmRotated/38 x 25 mm Cable Wrap Tag: "2.834646 0 104.881890 70.866142"

*% Physical paper dimensions
*DefaultPaperDimension: 50x100mm
*PaperDimension 50x100mm/50mm Continuous Roll: "141.732283 283.464567"
*PaperDimension 50x80mm/50 x 80 mm Label: "141.732283 226.771654"
*PaperDimension 50x70mm/50 x 70 mm Label: "141.732283 198.425197"
*PaperDimension 50x50mm/50 x 50 mm Label: "141.732283 141.732283"
*PaperDimension 30x50mmRotated/50 x 30 mm Label: "141.732283 85.039370"
*PaperDimension 40x60mm/40 x 60 mm Label: "113.385827 170.078740"
